{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1065159/block/singleImage/3274946/df/01KV43RYXECJJG0T92MH1K0VG7.jpg?updatedAt=1795400257\"/><figcaption>大埔汀角路途人報案，42歲私家車司機涉酒駕被捕。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>昨日 (22 日 ) 晚上 10 時 47 分，警方接獲途人報案，指懷疑一名私家車司機酒後駕駛。 人員接報到場，經初步調查，該名 42 歲姓梁男子未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。他已獲准保釋候查，須於 12 月下旬向警方報到。據悉，案發前有人在大美督燒烤場飲用兩罐啤酒及一杯紅酒。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.687741+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:17:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:32:28.647816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:41.453058+00:00","content_hash":"152620177934b6e8761c96185bf2eb64ff6a649b55ceb52b74f66c6092148b70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.687741+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}